    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d427">

                <pb facs="0409" n="401" sameAs="frus:frus1939v05/pg401"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.5151/1454: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-10-03T16:00:00-03:00">October 3, 1939—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 3—4 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>346. Embassy’s despatch 1768, September 18.<anchor n="67" xml:id="d427-f1"/> The
                    Director of the Exchange informs me that Bank of Brazil will resume the
                    allocation of dollar exchange for remittance of earnings and administrative
                    expenses of some foreign (predominantly American) companies operating in
                    Brazil.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
